  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c3b5c1d32f444744",
      "translationZh": "我很好奇，其他人在只有 8 GB 显存的情况下，使用什么来进行本地 LLM 编程 / 智能体编程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4585ec61efe2d01d",
      "translationZh": "RTX 3070 Laptop，8 GB 显存",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b6e84abf010a579",
      "translationZh": "使用 pi.dev 作为编程智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c41c2977668dd985",
      "translationZh": "在测试了不少不同的模型和量化方案之后，我目前选定的是：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d2f03b5e1193ebdd",
      "translationZh": "Unsloth 的 Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-UD-IQ4_NL",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7fcc3992b8014c78",
      "translationZh": "对于智能体编程任务，我的平均生成速度大约为 25 tokens/s，更重要的是，最终结果好得出乎意料。这个模型通常能够浏览代码库、使用工具、进行修改，并完成相当复杂的任务，而不需要我不断介入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "abf21278570c7c14",
      "translationZh": "对我来说，重要的指标并不只是最高 tokens/sec。我想找到以下方面的最佳组合：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "538f331eba7f358e",
      "translationZh": "速度 + 编码能力 + 工具使用 + 可靠性 + 最终结果的质量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6eeaf56b1a147819",
      "translationZh": "在最终选定 Qwen3.6 之前，我尝试过其他几个模型，但到目前为止，在我这套特定的硬件上，它在耗时、性能和结果之间提供了最佳的综合权衡。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c8f30d69e484ddb",
      "translationZh": "话虽如此，我显然还没有测试过所有可用的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "545abf6ebc097d45",
      "translationZh": "如果你有一块 8 GB 显存的 GPU，你目前用什么本地模型来编程或进行智能体编程？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ba7f06b86b52016",
      "translationZh": "尤其想知道：你实际的 tokens/s 是多少，结果又有多好？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4956a49d576fa358",
      "translationZh": "比起基准测试分数，我更关心实际使用体验：“我给了它这类编程任务，它还真能把任务完成。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b0b3bde1aa56e390",
      "translationZh": "在认定自己已经找到最适合的平衡点之前，我很想听听还有什么是我没考虑到的。🙂",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da963bf6007afe17",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Elemental_Particle 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
